cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite Sim (2007), MNRAS, 375, 154-162, doi:10.1111/j.1365-2966.2006.11271.x. Please also cite Kromer & Sim (2009), MNRAS, 398, 1809-1826, doi:10.1111/j.1365-2966.2009.15256.x. For polarisation and virtual packets, please cite Bulla, Sim & Kromer (2015), MNRAS, 450, 967-981, doi:10.1093/mnras/stv657. For non-LTE populations and the non-thermal solver, please cite Shingles et al. (2020), MNRAS, 492, 2029-2043, doi:10.1093/mnras/stz3412. For alpha, beta, and fission decays and time-dependent thermalisation, please cite Shingles et al. (2023), ApJL, 954, L41, doi:10.3847/2041-8213/acf29a."
